\">for his steadfast love endures forever.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v1\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.1\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.2\"><span class=\"label\">2</span><span class=\"content\">Give thanks to </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Deut. 10:17</span></span><span class=\"content\">the God of gods,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.2\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever.</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v2\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.2\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.3\"><span class=\"label\">3</span><span class=\"content\">Give thanks to </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">[See ver. 2 above]</span></span><span class=\"content\">the Lord of lords,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.3\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v3\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.3\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.4\"><span class=\"label\">4</span><span class=\"content\">to him who alone </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Ps. 72:18</span></span><span class=\"content\">does great wonders,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.4\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v4\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.4\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.5\"><span class=\"label\">5</span><span class=\"content\">to him who </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Prov. 3:19; Jer. 10:12; 51:15 </span></span><span class=\"content\">by understanding </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Gen. 1:1</span></span><span class=\"content\">made the heavens,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.5\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v5\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.5\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.6\"><span class=\"label\">6</span><span class=\"content\">to him who </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Isa. 42:5; 44:24 </span></span><span class=\"content\">spread out the earth </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 24:2</span></span><span class=\"content\">above the waters,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.6\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v6\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.6\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.7\"><span class=\"label\">7</span><span class=\"content\">to him who </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Gen. 1:16</span></span><span class=\"content\">made the great lights,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.7\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v7\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.7\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.8\"><span class=\"label\">8</span><span class=\"content\">the sun to rule over the day,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.8\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v8\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.8\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.9\"><span class=\"label\">9</span><span class=\"content\">the moon and stars to rule over the night,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.9\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v9\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.9\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.10\"><span class=\"label\">10</span><span class=\"content\">to him who </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Ps. 78:51</span></span><span class=\"content\">struck down the firstborn of Egypt,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.10\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v10\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.10\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.11\"><span class=\"label\">11</span><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ex. 12:51; 13:3</span></span><span class=\"content\">brought Israel out from among them,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.11\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v11\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.11\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.12\"><span class=\"label\">12</span><span class=\"content\">with </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Deut. 4:34</span></span><span class=\"content\">a strong hand and an outstretched arm,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.12\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v12\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.12\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.13\"><span class=\"label\">13</span><span class=\"content\">to him who </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">See Ps. 78:13</span></span><span class=\"content\">divided the Red Sea in two,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.13\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v13\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.13\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.14\"><span class=\"label\">14</span><span class=\"content\">  </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">    \n        Ex. 14:21, 22  </span></span><span class=\"content\">and made Israel pass through the midst of it,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.14\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v14\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.14\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.15\"><span class=\"label\">15</span><span class=\"content\">but </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ex. 14:27; [Ps. 78:53]</span></span><span class=\"content\">overthrew</span><span class=\"note f\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\"><span class=\"fr\">136:15 </span><span class=\"ft\">Hebrew </span><span class=\"fq\">shook off</span></span></span><span class=\"content\"> Pharaoh and his host in the Red Sea,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.15\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v15\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.15\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.16\"><span class=\"label\">16</span><span class=\"content\">to him who </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ex. 15:22; Deut. 8:15; See Ps. 77:20</span></span><span class=\"content\">led his people through the wilderness,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.16\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v16\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.16\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.17\"><span class=\"label\">17</span><span class=\"content\">to him </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">For ver. 17-22, see Ps. 135:10-12</span></span><span class=\"content\">who struck down great kings,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.17\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v17\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.17\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.18\"><span class=\"label\">18</span><span class=\"content\">and killed mighty kings,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.18\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v18\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.18\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.19\"><span class=\"label\">19</span><span class=\"content\">Sihon, king of the Amorites,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.19\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v19\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.19\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.20\"><span class=\"label\">20</span><span class=\"content\">and Og, king of Bashan,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.20\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v20\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.20\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.21\"><span class=\"label\">21</span><span class=\"content\">and gave their land as a heritage,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.21\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v21\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.21\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.22\"><span class=\"label\">22</span><span class=\"content\">a heritage to Israel his </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 105:6, 26</span></span><span class=\"content\">servant,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.22\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v22\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.22\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.23\"><span class=\"label\">23</span><span class=\"content\">It is he who </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Gen. 8:1; [Deut. 32:36]</span></span><span class=\"content\">remembered us in our low estate,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.23\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v23\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.23\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.24\"><span class=\"label\">24</span><span class=\"content\">and </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 107:2</span></span><span class=\"content\">rescued us from our foes,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.24\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever;</span></span></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v24\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.24\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v25\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.25\"><span class=\"label\">25</span><span class=\"content\">he who </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ps. 104:27; See Job 36:31</span></span><span class=\"content\">gives food to all flesh,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v25\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.25\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever.</span></span></div><div class=\"b\"></div><div class=\"q1\"><span class=\"verse v25\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.25\"><span class=\"content\">  </span></span><span class=\"verse v26\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.26\"><span class=\"label\">26</span><span class=\"content\">Give thanks to </span><span class=\"note x\"><span class=\"label\">#</span><span class=\" body\">Ezra 5:12; Neh. 1:4; Dan. 2:18</span></span><span class=\"content\">the God of heaven,</span></span></div><div class=\"q2\"><span class=\"verse v26\" data-usfm=\"PSA.136.26\"><span class=\"content\">for his steadfast love endures forever.</span></span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>", "copyright": {"html": "<p>The Holy Bible, English Standard Version\u00ae (ESV\u00ae), copyright \u00a9 2001 by C